  "description": "Disgraced and executed for a crime she did not commit, Lady Letizia Manere is reborn to a time before everything went wrong in her life. Determined to make sure she doesn’t suffer the same fate, Letizia rebels against her family and the confines of high society. When the mysterious man who showed her kindness in her past life is in danger, she intervenes and becomes embroiled in a plot she could have never imagined. Can Letizia save herself and those she loves when given a second chance at life?\nSource: Tapas\nA promotional chapter for the novel.",
